WEBVTT

01:30.300 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.780 --> 01:38.980
[Episode 1]

01:39.150 --> 01:41.850
The martial world of Beili is vast and turbulent.

01:42.920 --> 01:43.900
Xueyue City in the south,

01:44.200 --> 01:45.260
Wushuang City in the east,

01:45.760 --> 01:48.050
and the Tang Clan, together with other prestigious sects,

01:48.310 --> 01:50.820
built the brilliance and order of the martial world.

01:51.230 --> 01:52.490
But beneath the brilliance,

01:52.680 --> 01:53.820
there must be shadows.

01:54.230 --> 01:54.980
Blood River,

01:55.510 --> 01:58.020
the most mysterious assassin organization.

01:58.480 --> 01:59.620
Once you join Blood River,

02:00.070 --> 02:02.620
you live only as someone's blade.

02:03.710 --> 02:06.540
Still, there are those who seek light in the dark,

02:06.870 --> 02:09.730
hoping to reach the shore amid raging currents.

02:10.190 --> 02:11.260
The tide of Blood River

02:11.680 --> 02:12.820
begins

02:13.470 --> 02:15.220
to surge once more.

02:36.500 --> 02:38.240
[Su Muyu, Blood River]

02:38.240 --> 02:39.130
Why

02:53.240 --> 02:54.450
do I wield a sword?

02:56.380 --> 02:58.340
[Chou the Ox, one of the Twelve Zodiacs of Spider Shadow]

02:58.630 --> 02:59.260
Lord Kui,

02:59.750 --> 03:00.380
we have news.

03:06.700 --> 03:09.780
[The Patriarch's meeting Second Master Tang in Liaoluo City. There's an ambush.]

03:38.740 --> 03:41.300
[Second Master Tang, Tang Clan]

03:42.240 --> 03:45.610
The snow comes too late for spring,

03:46.310 --> 03:50.290
and turns into flying petals on the courtyard trees.

03:58.150 --> 04:00.340
I thought the winter

04:01.150 --> 04:02.220
had ended.

04:03.310 --> 04:05.450
People our age

04:05.750 --> 04:08.260
are always impatient

04:08.750 --> 04:11.130
for winter to pass.

04:11.470 --> 04:13.220
But somehow, just as it ended,

04:13.240 --> 04:14.570
it snowed again.

04:17.390 --> 04:18.610
Blood River,

04:19.430 --> 04:21.660
the world's best assassin organization.

04:22.630 --> 04:23.370
They kill ministers and nobles

04:23.480 --> 04:25.140
in the imperial court,

04:26.040 --> 04:26.810
or wipe out entire sects

04:27.480 --> 04:29.340
in the martial world.

04:30.480 --> 04:32.810
Right or wrong, good or evil.

04:33.630 --> 04:35.250
It means nothing to them.

04:36.240 --> 04:38.050
You've led such an organization

04:38.240 --> 04:39.250
for thirty years.

04:39.950 --> 04:41.250
You must be tired.

04:41.750 --> 04:43.730
I'm already an old man.

04:44.390 --> 04:46.250
[Patriarch of Blood River]
If not for an obsession,

04:47.800 --> 04:49.730
the blood inside me

04:50.390 --> 04:51.580
would've long gone cold.

04:52.360 --> 04:53.660
Thirty years ago,

04:54.040 --> 04:55.370
we had a duel,

04:55.560 --> 04:56.610
but there was no winner.

04:57.190 --> 04:57.980
As per our pact,

04:58.390 --> 05:00.490
I returned to lead the Blood River,

05:00.870 --> 05:02.980
and you assisted Grand Master Tang

05:03.000 --> 05:04.250
in rebuilding the Tang Clan.

05:04.750 --> 05:06.100
Thirty years later,

05:06.560 --> 05:08.220
we meet again to continue the duel.

05:08.390 --> 05:08.810
Yes.

05:10.310 --> 05:12.370
I've lived in seclusion in Liaoluo City for years.

05:13.950 --> 05:16.100
It's time to stretch my body.

05:16.830 --> 05:18.930
I've been waiting for this day.

06:08.430 --> 06:09.610
I was too arrogant when I was young.

06:09.920 --> 06:11.460
I tried to catch one of your hidden weapons with my bare hands

06:11.720 --> 06:12.900
and nearly died from the poison.

06:13.310 --> 06:15.050
I won't fall for that again.

06:15.680 --> 06:17.580
You may be able to catch a few of them,

06:18.270 --> 06:19.340
but what about

06:21.070 --> 06:22.410
Blossom Shower?

06:22.870 --> 06:24.050
How will you deal with that?

06:39.270 --> 06:42.100
What a brilliant move.

06:42.600 --> 06:44.170
It's been a long time

06:44.190 --> 06:45.580
since I've had such a great fight.

07:19.310 --> 07:21.140
The duel

07:21.160 --> 07:21.930
we promised thirty years ago

07:22.480 --> 07:23.980
is for victory,

07:24.750 --> 07:26.170
not for life.

07:26.800 --> 07:28.250
To an assassin,

07:29.120 --> 07:30.100
there's no victory or defeat,

07:30.750 --> 07:32.220
only life or death.

07:35.630 --> 07:37.020
What a shame.

07:37.920 --> 07:38.980
Shame?

07:40.600 --> 07:41.370
What a shame

07:42.390 --> 07:44.580
that your swift slash just now

07:45.510 --> 07:47.900
drained most of your zhenqi.

07:48.750 --> 07:49.700
And what a shame

07:50.240 --> 07:52.340
that you thought you were the one in control.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.140
Little did you know,

07:55.070 --> 07:58.100
you were also a pawn in someone else's game.

08:07.950 --> 08:08.580
Muyu,

08:09.120 --> 08:09.980
didn't I tell you

08:10.040 --> 08:11.100
not to meddle

08:11.800 --> 08:13.050
in my affairs?

08:13.630 --> 08:14.780
Someone wanted to attack you

08:14.830 --> 08:15.490
during your duel

08:16.000 --> 08:16.730
with Second Master Tang.

08:17.950 --> 08:19.540
Kill two birds with one stone, huh?

08:41.750 --> 08:42.820
Old fellow,

08:43.360 --> 08:45.250
you've had a killing intent

08:45.720 --> 08:47.100
during our duel.

08:47.870 --> 08:49.730
You know me.

08:51.080 --> 08:53.730
I've always demanded fairness.

08:57.510 --> 08:58.300
Show Falls

08:58.840 --> 08:59.850
on a Plum Blossom.

09:00.600 --> 09:02.100
On the road six feet under,

09:02.870 --> 09:04.610
I'll take my rest.

09:05.840 --> 09:08.650
Don't keep me waiting too long.

09:17.390 --> 09:17.770
Sir,

09:18.200 --> 09:19.010
let's head back to Blood River

09:19.720 --> 09:20.650
and get the best physician

09:20.670 --> 09:21.220
to heal you.

09:23.200 --> 09:24.300
We can't return to Blood River.

09:25.030 --> 09:25.650
Su,

09:26.030 --> 09:26.490
Mu,

09:27.080 --> 09:27.820
and Xie.

09:28.240 --> 09:29.490
How long do you think

09:29.630 --> 09:30.980
the Three Families have waited to hear

09:31.790 --> 09:32.730
that I was injured?

09:34.200 --> 09:35.770
Those assassins just now

09:36.600 --> 09:38.100
were all their people.

09:38.960 --> 09:39.340
But...

09:39.670 --> 09:40.530
Go to Qiantang City.

09:41.550 --> 09:42.250
I have an acquaintance

09:42.910 --> 09:43.940
there.

09:45.390 --> 09:47.940
The martial senior of the King of Medicine, Xin Baicao.

09:50.030 --> 09:50.490
Go...

09:51.320 --> 09:51.980
Go look for her.

09:52.440 --> 09:54.610
Her name is Bai Hehuai.

09:57.320 --> 09:59.010
[Three days later]
In the early spring

09:59.390 --> 10:00.220
of the 11th year of Mingde's reign,

10:00.320 --> 10:01.650
since the great calamity

10:01.910 --> 10:02.820
brought by the Demonic Sect,

10:02.960 --> 10:04.580
three years have passed.

10:05.200 --> 10:06.300
Now, the martial world

10:06.510 --> 10:08.650
is at peace, with fewer conflicts.

10:09.030 --> 10:10.010
Meanwhile, the Blood River

10:10.360 --> 10:10.890
hides

10:10.910 --> 10:12.770
in the most powerful sect,

10:13.270 --> 10:15.820
an assassin organization

10:15.960 --> 10:16.980
formed by the Su, Xie, and Mu families.

10:17.240 --> 10:19.580
[Second Master Tang has died.]
But now, the head of the Three Families,

10:20.000 --> 10:20.860
[Mu Mingce has been poisoned]
the Patriarch,

10:20.890 --> 10:21.370
[by Snow Falls on a Plum Blossom.]
has been poisoned,

10:21.600 --> 10:23.340
and turmoil is imminent.

10:23.870 --> 10:24.650
The martial world,

10:24.910 --> 10:26.250
and even the imperial court,

10:26.510 --> 10:27.730
which had rested in a fleeting peace,

10:27.870 --> 10:30.580
are about to be shattered.

10:31.240 --> 10:32.940
Mu Mingce's gravely injured.

10:33.440 --> 10:34.060
Seems like

10:34.960 --> 10:35.820
we need to choose

10:35.840 --> 10:37.730
a new patriarch.

10:38.630 --> 10:40.300
[Earth Official, Soul Reapers' Hall]
He's grown old

10:41.120 --> 10:42.460
[Water Official, Soul Reapers' Hall]
and slipping

10:42.510 --> 10:43.490
out of our control.

10:43.870 --> 10:45.490
Send word to the Three Families.

10:46.600 --> 10:48.220
If the Patriarch dies,

10:49.000 --> 10:51.220
whoever seizes the Dormant Dragon Sword first

10:51.870 --> 10:53.490
and returns to Soul Reapers' Hall to report

10:54.440 --> 10:55.180
shall be

10:55.600 --> 10:57.730
[Heaven Official, Soul Reapers' Hall]
the new patriarch.

10:59.550 --> 11:01.420
Then all hell will break loose.

11:01.720 --> 11:03.010
It's the chaos

11:03.480 --> 11:06.650
that brings forth a new head of Blood River.

11:16.860 --> 11:18.340
[Baihe Medicine Hall]

11:19.750 --> 11:21.260
Baihe Medicine Hall?

11:21.260 --> 11:22.510
[Su Changhe, the Su family]

11:22.510 --> 11:22.940
Here we are.

11:22.940 --> 11:24.630
[Su Zhe, the Su family]

11:24.630 --> 11:25.850
Your informant says

11:26.510 --> 11:28.460
they'll come here to look for that famed physician?

11:29.080 --> 11:29.490
Yes.

11:30.550 --> 11:31.730
The Patriarch was poisoned

11:31.750 --> 11:32.530
and won't last long.

11:32.960 --> 11:33.650
And here

11:34.120 --> 11:34.730
lives the martial senior

11:34.840 --> 11:36.010
of the King of Medicine.

11:36.440 --> 11:37.610
Master Su hopes

11:38.120 --> 11:39.370
this martial senior

11:39.720 --> 11:40.610
will not appear.

11:41.390 --> 11:42.180
Or better,

11:42.790 --> 11:43.700
he never existed.

11:50.360 --> 11:51.610
People chew betel nuts

11:51.630 --> 11:52.340
and smoke.

11:52.550 --> 11:53.980
They look like they're enjoying themselves.

11:54.630 --> 11:55.060
Uncle Zhe,

11:55.840 --> 11:57.130
why are you eating dried plums instead?

11:59.150 --> 12:00.650
There was once a woman who told me

12:01.550 --> 12:02.940
that betel nuts are bad for health.

12:05.390 --> 12:06.060
Do you want one?

12:07.200 --> 12:07.940
No thanks.

12:20.510 --> 12:21.250
Since when

12:21.270 --> 12:22.220
have you become so polite?

12:23.840 --> 12:24.770
I learned that from Su Muyu.

12:25.440 --> 12:26.650
An assassin should have manners

12:27.000 --> 12:28.300
when visiting someone's door.

12:31.240 --> 12:32.530
But this miracle physician

12:33.000 --> 12:34.340
doesn't seem to welcome us.

12:35.550 --> 12:37.220
Perhaps King of Medicine's martial senior

12:37.240 --> 12:38.060
is old,

12:38.360 --> 12:39.100
and his hearing has gone.

12:39.550 --> 12:41.130
Knock harder.

12:45.390 --> 12:46.010
Uncle Zhe,

12:46.510 --> 12:47.490
are you knocking?

12:47.960 --> 12:49.220
You looked more like trying to kill him.

12:50.550 --> 12:52.130
Aren't we here to kill him?

12:59.670 --> 13:00.460
Who's that?

13:00.720 --> 13:02.060
Making such noise.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.010
My ears will go deaf.

13:03.550 --> 13:03.940
Young lady,

13:04.910 --> 13:06.180
may I ask if your master

13:06.510 --> 13:07.420
is at home?

13:07.910 --> 13:08.730
My master

13:08.840 --> 13:09.940
has gone out to see patients.

13:10.240 --> 13:10.820
How about this?

13:11.030 --> 13:12.180
I'll look for him.

13:12.720 --> 13:13.890
That would be a great help, young lady.

13:27.750 --> 13:28.460
What did you do?

13:30.670 --> 13:32.250
Oh, my apologies. My hand slipped.

13:35.000 --> 13:35.370
Here.

13:35.390 --> 13:37.370
This is Scented Ointment.

13:38.200 --> 13:39.650
Rub it on your face,

13:39.870 --> 13:40.820
and in less than one hour,

13:41.120 --> 13:41.980
that red mark

13:42.150 --> 13:43.180
will disappear.

13:44.120 --> 13:45.010
Ridiculous.

13:53.320 --> 13:55.530
The Scented Ointment that can be tracked by medicine snakes.

13:56.200 --> 13:57.730
He thinks such tricks will fool me?

14:10.200 --> 14:10.730
Young lady,

14:11.480 --> 14:12.100
are you a physician?

14:13.510 --> 14:13.940
Why?

14:14.390 --> 14:15.650
Do I not look like one?

14:16.240 --> 14:16.580
I'm sorry.

14:17.000 --> 14:17.530
I didn't mean to offend you.

14:18.720 --> 14:19.300
Mister,

14:19.750 --> 14:20.530
are you asking for directions?

14:21.240 --> 14:21.770
You have keen eyes, young lady.

14:22.360 --> 14:23.010
May I ask

14:23.600 --> 14:24.890
if there's a medicine hall nearby

14:25.240 --> 14:26.010
called Baihe?

14:28.120 --> 14:29.340
Are you here to see a physician?

14:29.750 --> 14:30.490
I'm quite skilled myself.

14:31.080 --> 14:31.850
You can ask for my help.

14:32.390 --> 14:33.580
Someone in my family is seriously ill,

14:34.030 --> 14:34.700
and he specifically asked for

14:34.720 --> 14:35.890
the miracle physician of Baihe Medicine Hall.

14:36.630 --> 14:37.530
Anyway, thank you for your kindness.

14:39.440 --> 14:40.370
How do you know

14:41.270 --> 14:42.370
I'm not

14:42.390 --> 14:43.010
from Baihe Medicine Hall?

14:43.870 --> 14:44.980
Could it be that you are...

14:45.480 --> 14:46.300
Of course I am.

14:47.750 --> 14:48.490
Young lady, please

14:48.630 --> 14:50.010
take me to your master.

14:50.870 --> 14:51.580
My master?

14:54.440 --> 14:55.700
He can't come here right now,

14:56.480 --> 14:57.580
but he told me

14:58.120 --> 14:59.220
a guest was coming

15:00.030 --> 15:01.980
from very far away.

15:02.550 --> 15:03.890
It must be you, I suppose.

15:05.870 --> 15:07.820
He asked me to go with you first.

15:09.670 --> 15:10.180
I hope you don't mind.

15:10.750 --> 15:11.580
I'm in a rush,

15:11.870 --> 15:12.770
so please mount up.

15:26.000 --> 15:26.490
We've arrived.

15:36.870 --> 15:37.250
Sir.

15:38.360 --> 15:39.820
You've come just in time, sir.

15:40.000 --> 15:40.650
Something's wrong

15:40.790 --> 15:41.700
with the Patriarch.

15:42.510 --> 15:43.010
Where's the miracle physician?

15:44.200 --> 15:44.940
I'm standing

15:44.960 --> 15:45.730
right in front of you.

15:46.000 --> 15:46.890
How can you not see me?

15:48.000 --> 15:49.180
Is she the miracle physician?

15:49.440 --> 15:49.820
No.

15:50.390 --> 15:51.010
Fine, I'll leave.

15:51.240 --> 15:51.890
Please don't be offended.

15:53.630 --> 15:54.370
She's the miracle physician's disciple.

15:55.120 --> 15:55.980
She came on her master's behalf

15:56.270 --> 15:57.340
to check the Patriarch's condition.

15:58.000 --> 15:58.850
Please come with me.

16:28.360 --> 16:29.060
I feel

16:30.000 --> 16:32.100
there's a ghost inside.

16:37.120 --> 16:37.850
Don't be afraid, young lady.

16:57.030 --> 16:57.530
Sir.

17:06.960 --> 17:08.490
The last time I saw you,

17:09.350 --> 17:09.940
you were just

17:09.960 --> 17:11.700
a dirty kid with snot hanging.

17:12.960 --> 17:14.660
The last time I saw you,

17:14.960 --> 17:15.460
you were

17:15.720 --> 17:16.530
a god of killing

17:16.640 --> 17:18.010
who was ready to draw your blade at any time.

17:18.240 --> 17:20.620
I'm still ready to draw my blade anytime.

17:21.160 --> 17:22.620
Only my hair has turned white.

17:23.200 --> 17:24.180
My hands

17:25.160 --> 17:27.090
are still stained crimson.

17:27.960 --> 17:28.490
Enough talking.

17:31.920 --> 17:32.660
Let me read your pulse

17:33.030 --> 17:34.660
to see if you

17:34.920 --> 17:36.140
can still draw your sword.

17:53.270 --> 17:54.290
Put away your killing aura.

17:55.000 --> 17:56.490
If you scare me

17:56.830 --> 17:58.220
and my hand trembles,

17:58.750 --> 17:59.730
your Patriarch

17:59.880 --> 18:00.620
will be done for.

18:14.200 --> 18:15.140
Snow Falls on a Plum Blossom?

18:16.240 --> 18:16.770
That's right.

18:17.240 --> 18:19.380
How are you still alive?

18:23.550 --> 18:24.420
My Kui

18:24.550 --> 18:26.050
took the blow for me.

18:26.310 --> 18:28.330
Only half a plum hit me.

18:28.510 --> 18:29.900
I'm barely holding on.

18:31.030 --> 18:33.180
That's the Second Master Tang's

18:33.270 --> 18:34.490
signature poison.

18:34.960 --> 18:36.460
It's said to be the top poison of the Tang Clan,

18:36.880 --> 18:37.660
ranked second in the world,

18:38.310 --> 18:39.530
second only to the poison created by the Wen family head,

18:39.680 --> 18:40.810
Illusion.

18:41.240 --> 18:41.730
They say

18:42.110 --> 18:43.460
no one but Second Master Tang himself

18:44.000 --> 18:44.700
can cure it.

18:46.440 --> 18:47.330
Where's Second Master Tang?

18:48.310 --> 18:50.220
I killed him.

18:53.880 --> 18:55.220
I didn't know the Patriarch of Blood River

18:55.720 --> 18:57.330
would take a killing mission himself.

18:57.790 --> 18:58.490
Young lady,

18:59.400 --> 19:00.140
can you cure it?

19:01.000 --> 19:02.530
There's a saying in Medicine King Valley.

19:03.000 --> 19:04.860
"As long as one's not dead, they can be saved."

19:06.000 --> 19:07.050
However...

19:09.160 --> 19:10.140
Tell me what you need.

19:10.880 --> 19:11.660
Speak plainly.

19:13.590 --> 19:14.620
That's what I wanted to hear.

19:15.590 --> 19:15.980
Of course,

19:16.310 --> 19:17.180
I can heal him.

19:18.000 --> 19:18.530
As long as...

19:19.350 --> 19:19.980
As long as?

19:20.440 --> 19:21.380
...you can pay well.

19:40.510 --> 19:41.290
Looks like

19:41.310 --> 19:42.530
she's seen through your trick.

19:43.070 --> 19:44.250
She threw the bottle away

19:44.680 --> 19:45.730
as soon as she left the manor.

19:46.680 --> 19:48.010
Seems we were wrong.

19:49.270 --> 19:49.860
Wrong about what?

19:50.720 --> 19:52.730
We let the real miracle physician slip away.

19:53.310 --> 19:53.810
Fortunately,

19:54.720 --> 19:55.730
I made some preparations.

20:05.830 --> 20:06.380
Alright.

20:07.350 --> 20:08.620
Find me a place to stay.

20:08.830 --> 20:10.490
It's too much trouble running back and forth.

20:10.790 --> 20:12.140
Aren't you sending your master over?

20:12.480 --> 20:13.050
My master?

20:13.750 --> 20:14.940
He passed away a long time ago.

20:15.400 --> 20:16.730
Why do you all keep trying to make him

20:16.960 --> 20:18.420
crawl out from the grave?

20:18.750 --> 20:19.250
What?

20:21.030 --> 20:22.700
The King of Medicine's martial senior is dead?

20:24.750 --> 20:25.490
Muyu,

20:25.920 --> 20:26.940
you're mistaken.

20:27.680 --> 20:28.770
The person before you

20:29.030 --> 20:30.620
is the martial senior

20:30.640 --> 20:31.330
of the King of Medicine.

20:31.790 --> 20:33.860
The last disciple of Li Yuzhen,

20:34.240 --> 20:35.940
the founder of Medicine King Valley,

20:36.440 --> 20:37.660
Bai Hehuai.

20:38.790 --> 20:39.940
[Bai Hehuai, Medicine King Valley]
I'm Bai Hehuai, a physician.

20:40.240 --> 20:41.330
Greetings, sir.

20:44.750 --> 20:46.980
Greetings, Lord Kui.

20:51.550 --> 20:53.530
Lord Kui, I'm peckish.

20:55.750 --> 20:56.330
Forgive me, Miss Bai.

20:57.400 --> 20:58.290
We're in the wilderness.

20:58.750 --> 20:59.980
It's hard to find good food.

21:00.790 --> 21:01.380
This is all we have.

21:01.920 --> 21:02.420
That's all right.

21:02.720 --> 21:03.570
Having something to eat is good enough.

21:03.960 --> 21:04.460
Better than

21:04.590 --> 21:05.140
having to eat

21:05.200 --> 21:06.490
my martial senior's herbal cooking in the Medicine King Valley.

21:08.310 --> 21:09.900
You must be wondering

21:10.270 --> 21:11.730
how I know your identity.

21:12.480 --> 21:14.180
Since you and the Patriarch are old acquaintances,

21:15.350 --> 21:16.700
you must've heard of us.

21:17.270 --> 21:18.090
When I was little,

21:18.680 --> 21:20.290
my master used to tell me stories

21:20.920 --> 21:21.810
to make me study medicine.

21:22.510 --> 21:23.420
In his stories,

21:23.920 --> 21:24.570
there was often

21:24.680 --> 21:25.860
an organization called Blood River.

21:26.720 --> 21:28.700
It's formed by Su, Xie, and Mu,

21:29.160 --> 21:30.220
the Three Families.

21:30.750 --> 21:31.620
Their leader

21:32.200 --> 21:33.140
is known as the Patriarch.

21:33.790 --> 21:34.730
Under him

21:35.070 --> 21:36.420
is a direct assassin unit called Spider Shadow.

21:37.750 --> 21:38.670
[Rat, Snake, Ox, Rabbit, Dog, Tiger]
The strongest twelve

21:38.700 --> 21:39.000
[Horse, Dragon, Pig, Sheep, Chicken]
take the Earthly Branches

21:39.550 --> 21:41.050
as their code names,

21:41.790 --> 21:42.860
and their commander

21:43.270 --> 21:43.900
is Kui.

21:44.830 --> 21:46.380
The people I saw today

21:47.070 --> 21:48.380
all wore animal masks,

21:49.070 --> 21:49.660
but you alone

21:50.200 --> 21:51.660
wear a blood-red demon mask

21:52.070 --> 21:53.380
and stand beside the Patriarch.

21:54.550 --> 21:55.380
Who else could you be

21:56.030 --> 21:56.940
but Kui?

21:57.480 --> 21:58.700
Your understanding of us

22:00.270 --> 22:01.460
is much deeper than I imagined.

22:09.790 --> 22:10.380
I also know

22:10.790 --> 22:11.620
every Kui

22:12.350 --> 22:13.660
is trained

22:13.680 --> 22:14.180
as the future Patriarch.

22:15.400 --> 22:16.860
The last Kui

22:18.510 --> 22:19.180
is

22:20.110 --> 22:21.090
dead?

22:22.960 --> 22:23.420
I'm sorry.

22:24.350 --> 22:25.290
I couldn't tell you

22:26.200 --> 22:27.290
about such confidential matters.

22:28.310 --> 22:29.570
But the last Kui

22:30.070 --> 22:31.180
is my father.

22:34.640 --> 22:35.570
Can't I even ask about that?

22:36.960 --> 22:37.730
You must be kidding, Miss Bai.

22:38.510 --> 22:39.180
Forget it if you don't believe me.

22:39.960 --> 22:40.900
Whether someone lives or dies

22:41.000 --> 22:41.900
seems to be a secret to you.

22:42.350 --> 22:43.530
But given your sensitive identity,

22:44.200 --> 22:45.330
you're awfully conspicuous.

22:45.750 --> 22:46.940
Why not keep that a secret instead?

22:47.720 --> 22:49.050
I once asked my senior the same thing.

22:49.720 --> 22:50.420
As assassins,

22:51.310 --> 22:53.290
we should do everything possible to conceal our identities.

22:54.550 --> 22:55.290
Why do we

22:55.350 --> 22:55.980
wear it so plainly

22:56.030 --> 22:57.330
on our faces?

22:58.310 --> 22:59.090
What did he say?

23:01.110 --> 23:02.220
"It's a sense of ceremony.

23:02.750 --> 23:03.620
You don't understand a thing."

23:05.350 --> 23:06.860
Why are you suddenly slurring your words?

23:07.270 --> 23:08.140
I'm not slurring,

23:08.790 --> 23:09.810
he is.

23:14.550 --> 23:15.380
That reminds me.

23:15.920 --> 23:16.620
Could the man I saw

23:16.680 --> 23:17.460
during the day

23:17.880 --> 23:18.860
be from your sect?

23:19.510 --> 23:20.050
Does he carry

23:20.110 --> 23:21.010
a staff

23:21.310 --> 23:22.290
with golden rings on it?

23:22.680 --> 23:23.660
So Uncle Zhe came too.

23:24.920 --> 23:26.620
And the other one who plays with a dagger.

23:27.750 --> 23:28.570
That's Changhe.

23:29.750 --> 23:30.140
Chen the Dragon,

23:30.830 --> 23:31.330
get ready.

23:31.830 --> 23:33.290
Take Miss Bai and go now.

23:33.830 --> 23:34.250
Yes, sir.

23:35.160 --> 23:35.980
Where are we going?

23:36.880 --> 23:37.460
Jiuxiao City.

23:38.240 --> 23:39.660
No one knows Changhe better than I do.

23:40.400 --> 23:41.620
We've definitely walked into his trap

23:41.680 --> 23:42.490
by now.

23:43.960 --> 23:44.380
Yu,

23:45.960 --> 23:46.530
everything is set.

23:48.000 --> 23:48.420
Miss Bai,

23:49.110 --> 23:49.730
this is Mao the Rabbit.

23:49.730 --> 23:50.310
[Mao the Rabbit, one of the Twelve Zodiacs of Spider Shadow]

23:50.310 --> 23:51.050
Go with her.

23:52.000 --> 23:52.570
Take care.

23:52.920 --> 23:53.330
Lord Kui,

23:53.720 --> 23:55.660
I hope we'll meet again

23:55.920 --> 23:56.770
in Jiuxiao City.

23:57.310 --> 23:58.220
Don't call me Lord Kui.

23:59.350 --> 24:00.330
Just call me Su Muyu.

24:00.590 --> 24:01.730
Su Muyu.

24:02.400 --> 24:03.570
That really is a beautiful name.

24:04.110 --> 24:04.530
See you.

24:22.720 --> 24:23.330
You said you made preparations.

24:23.400 --> 24:24.290
And we're just waiting here?

24:26.400 --> 24:27.940
The Xie's blade, and the Mu's ghost.

24:28.350 --> 24:29.570
They're getting impatient.

24:29.960 --> 24:30.810
But I'm different.

24:31.440 --> 24:32.250
I'm lazy.

24:32.920 --> 24:33.770
It's better to follow

24:33.830 --> 24:34.860
those who hustle.

24:35.240 --> 24:36.570
I may be slower,

24:37.110 --> 24:38.180
but never late.

24:40.480 --> 24:42.140
You broke the news to them,

24:42.790 --> 24:44.290
and both families sent people here?

24:45.790 --> 24:47.460
You sly kid.

24:48.440 --> 24:49.460
Master Su sent you over.

24:50.510 --> 24:51.980
He's determined to take that seat.

24:53.550 --> 24:55.660
The cleverest me and the strongest you.

24:56.310 --> 24:56.700
Uncle Zhe,

24:57.240 --> 24:58.660
once Blood River's top assassin,

24:58.880 --> 24:59.940
the previous Lord Kui.

25:08.860 --> 25:09.690
[Mu and Xie have arrived at the abandoned post on the outskirts. ]

25:09.710 --> 25:10.750
[Only one of the Three Families has yet to show up.]

25:10.750 --> 25:11.980
An abandoned post on the outskirts?

25:12.400 --> 25:13.620
The show's about to start.

25:16.310 --> 25:16.980
Let's go, Uncle Zhe.

25:17.550 --> 25:18.860
Master Su

25:19.030 --> 25:19.900
must be anxious by now.

25:30.640 --> 25:31.980
As expected

25:32.030 --> 25:32.810
of the infamous Umbrella Ghost.

25:33.960 --> 25:34.940
This line marks the boundary.

25:35.400 --> 25:37.180
Please don't cross it.

25:38.070 --> 25:39.240
[Xie Qianji, the Xie family]
Purple Boot Ghost and

25:39.260 --> 25:41.530
Blade Yama of the Xie family.

25:41.530 --> 25:42.180
[Xie Jinke, the Xie family]

25:43.070 --> 25:44.700
You shouldn't be here.

25:45.640 --> 25:46.050
What a bore.

25:46.680 --> 25:47.250
You saw through us

25:47.310 --> 25:48.420
right away.

25:48.680 --> 25:50.050
But our family head heard

25:50.200 --> 25:51.460
that the Patriarch had been badly injured.

25:51.680 --> 25:52.860
He was anxious

25:53.070 --> 25:54.420
and wanted to bring him back

25:54.590 --> 25:55.730
to the main hall for treatment.

25:56.400 --> 25:57.530
The Patriarch is fine.

25:58.750 --> 25:59.980
Whether the Patriarch is fine,

26:00.590 --> 26:01.860
please allow me

26:02.270 --> 26:03.490
to see him

26:03.920 --> 26:04.940
and confirm.

26:05.270 --> 26:06.460
Otherwise,

26:07.030 --> 26:07.900
I can't explain it.

26:08.880 --> 26:10.180
What does that

26:11.110 --> 26:12.570
have to do with me?

26:13.000 --> 26:13.700
You don't want us

26:13.720 --> 26:14.860
to see the Patriarch.

26:15.640 --> 26:17.250
Do you intend

26:18.110 --> 26:19.490
to delay the treatment we offer?

26:20.510 --> 26:21.570
That would be one good reason.

26:22.200 --> 26:24.010
But for that reason to hold,

26:25.200 --> 26:26.460
there's only one possibility.

26:27.160 --> 26:27.810
Kill you?

26:29.640 --> 26:30.330
That's right.

27:00.960 --> 27:02.330
A blade hidden in the umbrella?

27:02.440 --> 27:03.770
Why not show it?

27:10.920 --> 27:12.700
The Xie family's Wind Whirling Blade.

27:13.440 --> 27:14.140
Impressive.

27:14.920 --> 27:15.330
Die!

27:37.240 --> 27:38.330
Do you really think I'm that weak?

27:38.480 --> 27:39.490
Inch Blade.

27:39.880 --> 27:40.700
Good one.

27:47.240 --> 27:48.770
Tell your family head.

27:49.550 --> 27:50.660
If he withdraws now,

27:51.440 --> 27:52.810
the Patriarch

27:53.310 --> 27:54.420
will pretend

27:54.440 --> 27:55.330
nothing happened.

27:56.160 --> 27:57.730
If he keeps being stubborn,

27:58.160 --> 28:00.460
don't blame the Spider Shadow for being ruthless.

28:01.550 --> 28:02.420
Are you going to

28:03.030 --> 28:04.380
spare us?

28:05.200 --> 28:06.250
Fellow members of the Blood River

28:07.510 --> 28:08.660
are family.

28:10.000 --> 28:10.380
Let's go.

28:18.510 --> 28:19.180
You're here.

28:20.640 --> 28:21.250
You don't look pleased

28:21.270 --> 28:22.090
to see me,

28:22.750 --> 28:24.050
my Lord Kui.

28:24.240 --> 28:25.420
I knew you'd come,

28:26.920 --> 28:28.660
but I hoped you'd come later.

28:30.270 --> 28:31.530
Master Su asked me to relay a message.

28:32.110 --> 28:33.730
You're part of the Su family.

28:35.270 --> 28:36.420
Now I am Kui,

28:37.240 --> 28:38.180
the ghost among men.

28:38.720 --> 28:39.700
I belong to Blood River,

28:39.920 --> 28:41.420
not to any single family.

28:42.160 --> 28:43.330
You're always so serious.

28:44.920 --> 28:45.980
No fun at all.

28:46.720 --> 28:47.900
When you were a Nameless,

28:48.550 --> 28:50.290
you woke up early to practice swordwork.

28:50.310 --> 28:50.730
You were

28:50.750 --> 28:52.140
a hardworking practitioner.

28:52.550 --> 28:53.530
Later, when you became an assassin,

28:53.920 --> 28:54.570
every mission

28:54.590 --> 28:55.660
you completed

28:55.680 --> 28:56.420
was flawless.

28:57.200 --> 28:58.010
Now you're a Kui,

28:58.550 --> 28:59.770
and you're still so diligent.

29:00.510 --> 29:02.220
The Patriarch is dying soon.

29:03.440 --> 29:04.180
Are you going to throw your life away

29:04.240 --> 29:05.010
for him?

29:05.400 --> 29:06.380
The Patriarch is fine.

29:07.350 --> 29:08.180
You shouldn't have started

29:09.160 --> 29:10.330
this rumor.

29:12.000 --> 29:13.010
If he were fine,

29:13.720 --> 29:14.570
why would he have looked for

29:14.640 --> 29:16.330
Xin Baicao's martial senior?

29:19.000 --> 29:19.730
If you kill him

29:20.270 --> 29:21.460
and take the Dormant Dragon Sword,

29:22.200 --> 29:22.940
you could get

29:23.000 --> 29:24.290
what you want most.

29:25.030 --> 29:25.860
Freedom.

29:26.830 --> 29:27.420
Right.

29:28.270 --> 29:30.140
Leave the Su family. Leave the Blood River.

29:30.550 --> 29:31.730
Go wherever you want.

29:31.790 --> 29:32.980
Do whatever you like.

29:34.640 --> 29:35.330
You know

29:35.920 --> 29:36.730
Blood River has

29:36.790 --> 29:37.570
never allowed that.

29:38.200 --> 29:39.290
Yet Master Su

29:39.920 --> 29:41.010
is willing to make an exception for you.

29:41.510 --> 29:42.420
What if I say no?

29:45.640 --> 29:46.420
We are the Sus.

29:47.000 --> 29:48.420
We've lived in the Su residence for so many years.

29:49.070 --> 29:49.810
You've only followed him

29:49.830 --> 29:51.380
for years as a Kui.

29:52.480 --> 29:53.420
How deep can your bond with him

29:53.720 --> 29:54.700
be compared to the Su family?

29:55.480 --> 29:56.460
I don't care

29:56.480 --> 29:57.250
what you think.

29:58.310 --> 29:59.220
Right now I am Kui,

30:00.030 --> 30:00.620
and my duty is

30:00.640 --> 30:02.250
to keep the Patriarch safe.

30:02.750 --> 30:03.420
Everything

30:04.240 --> 30:04.980
or every condition

30:05.880 --> 30:06.420
mustn't

30:06.480 --> 30:07.730
go beyond this.

30:20.550 --> 30:21.380
Yes.

30:22.160 --> 30:22.940
That's right.

30:24.310 --> 30:24.730
I replied to Master Su

30:24.750 --> 30:25.980
exactly the same thing.

30:26.550 --> 30:27.090
I knew

30:27.110 --> 30:28.010
you'd say that.

30:28.590 --> 30:29.250
And?

30:29.790 --> 30:31.090
And he said,

30:32.270 --> 30:33.090
"If that's the case,

30:33.920 --> 30:34.700
kill him."

30:51.760 --> 30:55.240
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

30:55.280 --> 30:59.160
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

31:01.160 --> 31:04.720
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

31:04.760 --> 31:08.520
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

31:10.680 --> 31:13.600
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

31:14.160 --> 31:16.120
♪Still I can't let go♪

31:16.400 --> 31:19.520
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

31:19.960 --> 31:22.040
♪My heart no longer my own♪

31:22.480 --> 31:27.360
♪No one can escape from love♪

31:43.800 --> 31:47.440
♪How many hidden feelings♪

31:47.840 --> 31:50.840
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

31:53.080 --> 31:56.840
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

31:57.160 --> 32:00.760
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

32:02.400 --> 32:05.080
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

32:05.360 --> 32:09.400
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

32:11.800 --> 32:15.760
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

32:15.920 --> 32:19.080
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

32:21.160 --> 32:24.640
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

32:24.680 --> 32:29.680
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

32:30.560 --> 32:34.120
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

32:34.160 --> 32:39.120
